// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// preservation/inventory — Wave 6: the machine-readable preservation inventory
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// The single catalog of everything Waves 1–5 expose that the full-site rebuild MUST
// carry forward unchanged. Generated by reading the current app/route tree, canonical
// metrix engine, storage helpers, cloud schema, analytics, and SEO surfaces as of the
// Wave 6 branch point. Treat this file as an append-only contract: removing an entry is
// a breaking change and the Wave 6 preservation tests will fail if a route, id, key,
// table, or event silently disappears.
//
// Pure data + small pure validators. No runtime side effects, no I/O.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

